     1872             accumulate tt-calcwast.oborot        (total).
     1873             accumulate tt-calcwast.allowed-wast  (total).
     1874             accumulate tt-calcwast.over-wast     (total).
     1875             accumulate tt-calcwast.all-wast-rubl (total).
     1876             accumulate tt-calcwast.deficit-rubl  (total).
