     1888                   CHR(9) "Итоги по производителю" CHR(9) (accum sub-total by tt-calcwast.prod-code tt-calcwast.deficit)
     1889                                                          CHR(9)
     1890                                                          CHR(9)
     1891                                                          CHR(9) (accum sub-total by tt-calcwast.prod-code tt-calcwast.oborot )
     1892                                                          CHR(9) (accum sub-total by tt-calcwast.prod-code tt-calcwast.allowed-wast)
